{"pdfData":[[{"bbox":[30,66,120,122],"type":"header","angle":0,"index":-99999,"text":"8 电 Design ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"7ba7d08c-d08f-40a8-9747-15b7e94c2f31","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-0"},{"bbox":[149,80,490,128],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":1,"level":1,"text":"# 2026年全国大学生电子设计竞赛赛区赛(TI杯) 暨模拟电子系统设计专题赛选拔赛赛题","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"6395552f-842a-4551-bb3d-8e748d04398a","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-1"},{"bbox":[253,139,340,153],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"参赛注意事项 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"862b5a7b-a867-4b62-aaa0-36b9b471f5f3","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-2"},{"bbox":[83,156,517,196],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（1）7 月 29 日 8:00 竞赛正式开始。每支参赛队可在赛区发布题目中任选一题，必须在竞赛第 一天将竞赛选题上报赛区组委会。参赛队中有本科生成员即为本科参赛队，建议赛区对本 科组参赛队和高职高专组参赛队分开评审及评奖。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"0299008d-5553-4c64-a9a4-008371cab59a","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-3"},{"bbox":[83,197,470,211],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（2）参赛队认真填写《登记表》内容，填写好的《登记表》交赛场巡视员暂时保存。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"506aebe2-1b42-4d13-bcde-91fd554cd675","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-4"},{"bbox":[83,211,517,238],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（3）参赛者必须是有正式学籍的全日制在校本科、高职高专学生，并出示能够证明参赛者学生 身份的有效证件（如学生证）随时备查。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"61ff8d53-0d72-4603-a9db-246e9859736e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-5"},{"bbox":[83,238,323,251],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（4）每队严格限制3 人，开赛后不得中途更换队员。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"4bd9021b-7f86-4f63-b579-96e61c819af2","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-6"},{"bbox":[83,252,517,291],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（5）竞赛期间，可使用各种图书资料和网络资源，但不得在学校指定竞赛场地外进行设计制作， 不得以任何方式与他人交流，包括教师在内的非参赛队员必须迴避，对违纪参赛队取消评 审资格。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"180eeb58-ed35-4f11-b1bd-c59eb4e00bfd","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-7"},{"bbox":[82,292,505,322],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（6）8月1日20:00 竞赛结束，上交设计报告、制作实物及《登记表》，由专人封存。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"4cc47d6b-3591-456c-a9f4-c7ab03e5fdf1","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-8"},{"bbox":[183,334,402,354],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":9,"level":2,"text":"## 周期信号测量分析装置（G 题）","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"a1a86925-c50a-4ba7-bef9-afea3c5414ec","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-9"},{"bbox":[76,364,138,380],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":10,"level":2,"text":"## 一、任务","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"c51139dc-a8f0-4d3f-85d1-5cc59fb6c153","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-10"},{"bbox":[76,391,517,466],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":11,"merge_prev":false,"text":"设计制作周期信号测量分析装置（以下简称为装置），可对信号源输出的周期信 号u 进行测量与分析，信号源输出阻抗为 50Ω。装置既能在显示屏上稳定显示u 的波 形图或电压频谱图，也能稳定显示u 的时域或频域相关参数值，频率分辨率 500Hz。 装置组成框图如图1所示。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"ccf7b326-173b-4d83-bd37-abcf6921e2e3","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-11"},{"bbox":[201,476,395,563],"type":"image","angle":0,"index":12,"img_path":"/0fd45ef73c6d32b2a061ff61e7a9760a6ddf473a3d4b728e61a9482a5f38fe5a.jpg","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"img_ratio":0.32605042016806723,"page_idx":0,"id":"9f6126ea-23f1-4af7-a160-4083975d35f4","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-12"},{"bbox":[254,569,345,582],"type":"image_caption","angle":0,"index":13,"text":"图 1 装置组成框图","id":"9d13bfbf-9216-41fd-98fe-8f5351d85447","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-13"},{"bbox":[76,592,138,608],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":14,"level":2,"text":"## 二、要求","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"abe78f0d-6606-45cc-b087-12178a7bff3d","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-14"},{"bbox":[76,613,517,648],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"merge_prev":false,"text":"1. 装置输入 $u = u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ ，其电压峰峰值 $U _ { \\mathrm { p p } } { = } 1 0 0 \\mathrm { m V } { \\sim } 2 5 0 \\mathrm { m V }$ ，所有频率成分均在 10kHz~200kHz 范围内。下列四项要求在启动装置后，每一项完成时间不超过 2 秒。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"eaec562f-833c-4ac4-be53-e55be77af42e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-15"},{"bbox":[105,652,452,667],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":16,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（1）键控选择一屏显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 的1个或者 3个完整周期波形。（6分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"504cc205-83d2-498f-a7d3-18bb522425d7","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-16"},{"bbox":[76,673,517,708],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":17,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（2）显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 的电压峰峰值 $U _ { \\mathfrak { p p } }$ 、有效值 $U _ { \\mathrm { m s } }$ ，误差的绝对值均≤5mV；显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 的 基频值 $f _ { \\mathrm { a l } }$ ，误差的绝对值≤1kHz。（13分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"40f54cc6-43eb-461c-a498-057c4274daaa","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-17"},{"bbox":[105,713,320,727],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":18,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（3）定性显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 的电压频谱图。（5 分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"fdae1661-f460-44a4-90b3-64168e1be635","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-18"},{"bbox":[105,733,476,747],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":19,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（4）显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 的电压频谱各分量的幅值，误差的绝对值≤5mV。（9分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"9d6c08a1-9ba4-46de-96fe-1f5bc0e67348","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-19"},{"bbox":[100,753,517,767],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":20,"merge_prev":false,"text":"2．装置输入 $u = u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ ，其电压峰峰值为 50mV~250mV，所有频率成分均在 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"id":"ba3c0632-64f4-449f-9611-6606b9299adc","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-20"},{"bbox":[277,780,317,791],"type":"page_number","angle":0,"index":1000020,"text":"G - 1 / 3 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":0,"is_discarded":true,"id":"d0a047a3-5be6-4689-bdce-7efe2a6c67cc","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"0-21"}],[{"bbox":[77,76,516,91],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"10kHz~500kHz 范围内。下列四项要求在启动装置后，每一项完成时间不超过 2 秒。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"444cab87-17ac-4530-bffc-94c60d297433","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-0"},{"bbox":[105,96,453,111],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":1,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（1）键控选择一屏显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的1个或者 3个完整周期波形。（6分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"019f54c2-14c1-4f3d-9290-f46918435684","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-1"},{"bbox":[76,116,517,151],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":2,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（2）显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压峰峰值 $U _ { \\mathfrak { p p } }$ 、有效值 $U _ { \\mathrm { m s } }$ ，误差的绝对值均≤5mV；显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的 基频值 $f _ { \\mathrm { { b l } } }$ ，误差的绝对值≤1kHz。（13分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"233ac602-370e-4562-9e22-df93f4a9ae96","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-2"},{"bbox":[105,156,319,170],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":3,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（3）定性显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压频谱图。（5 分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"ee2660e1-957c-4f2b-8385-628ed9945755","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-3"},{"bbox":[105,175,476,190],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":4,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（4）显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压频谱各分量的幅值，误差的绝对值≤5mV。（9分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"343f5946-843d-4378-929b-9c1981361066","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-4"},{"bbox":[76,195,516,271],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":5,"merge_prev":false,"text":"3．装置输入 $u = u _ { \\mathrm { b } } + u _ { \\mathrm { J } }$ ，其中被测信号 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压峰峰值为 50mV~250mV，所有 频率成分均在 10kHz~500kHz范围内；单频干扰 $u _ { \\mathrm { J } }$ 的电压峰峰值为200mV、频率 $f _ { \\mathrm { J } }$ ${ \\geqslant } 1 \\mathrm { M H z }$ 。要求装置能在抑制单频干扰 $u _ { \\mathrm { J } }$ 影响的基础上，完成下列四项要求，在启动 装置后，每一项完成时间不超过2秒。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"994cf7fc-7ef4-4621-aac1-5a1e519d2d0e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-5"},{"bbox":[105,275,452,290],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":6,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（1）键控选择一屏显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的1个或者 3个完整周期波形。（6分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"d5d759f5-d880-4780-b863-34434ac5a865","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-6"},{"bbox":[77,296,517,332],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":7,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（2）显示信号 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压峰峰值 $U _ { \\mathrm { p p } }$ 、有效值 $U _ { \\mathrm { m s } }$ ，误差的绝对值均≤5mV；显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的基频值 $f _ { \\mathrm { { b l } } }$ ，误差的绝对值≤1kHz。（15 分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"62c82d9b-9cba-4f8a-a2cf-1077d89fd2ed","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-7"},{"bbox":[105,336,319,350],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":8,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（3）定性显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压频谱图。（5 分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"54516439-a94e-4de8-ad7d-a64b96b7f272","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-8"},{"bbox":[105,356,475,370],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":9,"merge_prev":false,"text":"（4）显示 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压频谱各分量的幅值，误差的绝对值≤5mV。（8分） ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"a8ce5dcc-9ccf-40bf-afa2-241e0b9f6f0b","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-9"},{"bbox":[100,375,215,391],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":10,"level":2,"text":"## 4．设计报告（20分）","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"4522c976-da9b-41d4-a01e-08f866658aab","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-10"},{"bbox":[76,401,137,419],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":11,"level":2,"text":"## 三、说明","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"92ac8b4d-991f-4d89-a133-8b7ec39cbebb","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-11"},{"bbox":[76,431,517,466],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":12,"merge_prev":false,"text":"1. 装置测量与分析的信号 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 或 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 是由基波分量与1个或者2个谐波分量组合而 成的周期信号。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"93b78c7d-2060-49a1-a6d6-b112a6d031c6","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-12"},{"bbox":[99,471,497,486],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":13,"merge_prev":false,"text":"2. 装置在时域测量分析状态下，测量显示的电压有效值应为“真有效值”。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"73e3b4e8-3105-4480-bbde-f43741381596","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-13"},{"bbox":[76,493,517,571],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":14,"merge_prev":false,"text":"3．装置在频域测量分析状态下，显示的 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 或 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 电压频谱应为在正频率轴上分布 的频率分量。如信号源输出的由基波与其三次、四次谐波组合而成的周期信号表达式 为 $u = U _ { \\mathrm { 1 } } \\sin \\left( 2 \\pi \\times 1 0 . 5 \\times 1 0 ^ { 3 } t \\right) + U _ { \\mathrm { 3 } } \\sin \\left( 2 \\pi \\times 3 1 . 5 \\times 1 0 ^ { 3 } t \\right) + U _ { \\mathrm { 4 } } \\sin \\left( 2 \\pi \\times 4 2 . 0 \\times 1 0 ^ { 3 } t \\right) \\left( \\mathrm { m V } \\times \\mathrm { , } \\mathrm { ~ m } \\right)$ ）时， 装置显示的电压频谱各分量的频率和幅值应为： ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"bbb01818-17cc-4af8-ac51-338aeed66be1","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-14"},{"bbox":[97,577,196,634],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":15,"merge_prev":false,"text":"10.5 kHz，U mV 31.5 kHz，U<sub>3</sub> mV 42.0kHz， $U _ { 4 }$ mV ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"48aade79-c55a-431a-9501-242d6b010649","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-15"},{"bbox":[76,640,518,698],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":16,"merge_prev":false,"text":"4．定性显示电压频谱图：显示电压频谱图的坐标不一定加刻度，频谱图中正频 率轴上离散谱线的根数、谱线频率相对位置、谱线长度之间的相对比例与装置输入信 号 $u _ { \\mathrm { a } }$ 或 $u _ { \\mathrm { b } }$ 的电压频谱大体吻合即可。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"cb16b8b5-beb7-4321-8a20-b73be25c135e","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-16"},{"bbox":[100,703,317,718],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":17,"merge_prev":false,"text":"5．装置采用单路5V直流稳压电源供电。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"81d898d2-0dff-4cfc-a379-e6f8fec15740","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-17"},{"bbox":[100,723,266,737],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":18,"merge_prev":false,"text":"6. 装置的显示屏尺寸 $\\geqslant 6$ 英寸。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"id":"ff4365c6-e903-4649-bb61-9700158421a1","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-18"},{"bbox":[277,780,317,791],"type":"footer","angle":0,"index":1000018,"text":"G - 2 / 3 ","color":{"line":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)","fill":"rgba(164, 164, 164, 1)"},"page_idx":1,"is_discarded":true,"id":"010c0bf3-7fe0-4934-a329-4492d44f0359","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"1-19"}],[{"bbox":[76,76,518,171],"type":"text","angle":0,"index":0,"merge_prev":false,"text":"7．本题信号源输出电缆阻抗 50Ω，电缆两端均为 BNC 接头（电缆应带至测试 现场备用），参赛装置电路板上需焊接BNC 接头座，作为装置输入信号端口。信号 源可使用具有“谐波发生器”功能的信号发生器，设置其输出信号u的基波与谐波分 量幅度与频率值，各参数设置值作为相应参数测量的标称值。允许参赛队携带自用信 号发生器参加作品测试。 ","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"4a8a84f7-5dcd-435f-81c5-95f063a7aae9","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-0"},{"bbox":[77,179,166,195],"type":"title","angle":0,"index":1,"level":2,"text":"## 四、评分标准","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_idx":2,"id":"fd0bbcca-c4cf-4d3c-bee2-74558c7198ae","page_size":[595,841],"block_position":"2-1"},{"bbox":[83,201,510,451],"type":"table_body","angle":0,"index":2,"img_path":"/","id":"5515c657-7786-403e-b5aa-c4a82ac01bab","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"table_body":"<table><tr><td></td><td>项目</td><td>主要内容</td><td>满分</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"6\">设计报告</td><td>方案论证</td><td>比较与选择,方案描述。</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>理论分析与计算</td><td>系统相关参数设计</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>电路与程序设计</td><td>系统组成,原理框图与各部分电路图,系统软件与流程图。</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>测试方案与测试结果</td><td>测试结果完整性,测试结果分析。</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>设计报告结构及规范性</td><td>摘要,正文结构规范,图表的完整与准确性。</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">合计</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"4\">要求</td><td colspan=\"2\">完成第1项</td><td>33</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">完成第2项</td><td>33</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">完成第3项</td><td>34</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">合计</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">总分</td><td>120</td></tr></table>","page_idx":2,"page_size":[595,841],"block_posit